### Screening run artefacts ###
# Runtime output, not source: submissions.jsonl, results.jsonl, results.json and the
# committee flagged.csv, one directory per batch. For real congress batches these hold
# unpublished abstract titles, full abstract text and reviewers internal rationale
# prose; this repo is public, so they must never be committed. The dashboard reads them
# straight off the filesystem, so nothing in git needs them.
#
# Two locations because novelty.work-dir resolves against the app CWD: the repo root
# when started from here, workflow/ when started the documented way (see
# SCREENING_RUNBOOK.md). workflow/.gitignore covers the second one.
data/
